 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">학</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">생들이 직접 창작한 UCC도 보고 학생평가단으로서 평가도 해 주셨으면</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">합니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">금오공대 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개최 목적</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업동아리 및 창업에 관심있는 재학생의 동아리 활동</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">작품제작활동 등 창의적인 활동을 기록한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를 제작</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업에 대한 관심으로 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연결하여 창업동아리 홍보 및 네트워킹 강화를 위한 경진대회 개최</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD