so-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일 시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2012</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">11</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 16:00~18:00</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">장 소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">디지털관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">B127호 시청각실</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">참가대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업동아리 및 재학생으로 구성된 개인 또는 팀</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">제작분야 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업동아리 활동</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">작품제작 활동 등 창의적인 활동 관련 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기록물</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">제작유형 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">상영시간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">분</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">~5</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">분 내외 동영상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-S